From: Eeman1113 <eeman.majumder@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Read and save es_input.cfg in the home directory

fcamod hard-codes /etc/emulationstation/es_input.cfg, which is on the read-only
(for the ES user) system partition: presets there are skipped and remaps are
lost. Use ~/.emulationstation/es_input.cfg like upstream EmulationStation.
---
--- a/es-core/src/InputManager.cpp	2026-11-11 20:26:35
+++ b/es-core/src/InputManager.cpp	2026-11-11 20:26:35
@@ -443,9 +443,8 @@
 
 std::string InputManager::getConfigPath()
 {
-	std::string path; // = Utils::FileSystem::getHomePath();
-	//path += "/.emulationstation/es_input.cfg";
-	path += "/etc/emulationstation/es_input.cfg";
+	std::string path = Utils::FileSystem::getHomePath();
+	path += "/.emulationstation/es_input.cfg";
 	return path;
 }
 
